<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL Z AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL Z AUG NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.05 vs   1.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.20 vs   1.21</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.36 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Sales		   13.39 vs  13.50</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.99 vs   5.63</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.31 vs   6.69</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.55 vs   5.42</p>
<p> Sales		  134.81 vs  86.95</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Mostostal</p>
<p>Zabrze Holding SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
